1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,520
Keyword: Flash

2
00:00:02,520 --> 00:00:04,540
Heroes with Flash teleport
when combat begins

3
00:00:04,540 --> 00:00:08,440
to the mirrored position
on the enemy's battlefield.

4
00:00:08,440 --> 00:00:11,080
These heroes usually deal high damage.

5
00:00:11,080 --> 00:00:16,920
They bypass frontline tanks
to target the enemy's backline carries.

6
00:00:16,920 --> 00:00:19,740
Special equipment from talents
can also grant Flash

7
00:00:19,740 --> 00:00:25,025
to the hero wearing it.
